  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: Command injection in netbeans interface\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-39881.patch: add nb_is_safe_string() in\n       src/netbeans.c and validate typeName, fg and bg in defineAnnoType\n       and key tokens in special_keys() against an allowlist before they\n       reach coloncmd()/do_map(), preventing a malicious netbeans server\n       from injecting Ex commands via '|'\n     - CVE-2026-39881",
